    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHooke & MacDonald are delighted to present this spacious and modern one-bedroom apartment, ideally situated on the first floor of this highly regarded apartment development, extending to approximately 42sq.m.\n\nAccessed from Cows Lane, this well-presented apartment offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, featuring a comfortable living room with a south-facing private balcony overlooking the internal landscaped courtyard, a separate kitchen, and a generous double bedroom with ample storage.\n\nThe property benefits from a practical and efficient layout, ideal for modern city living, and is sure to appeal to both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\n\nLocated just off Cows Lane, the property enjoys a prime position at the residential west end of Temple Bar, while still being within easy walking distance of key city centre amenities — including approximately 10 minutes to Grafton Street, 10 minutes to the Trinity Luas Green Line stop, and 15 minutes to St. Stephen's Green. Trinity College, College Green, and a wide array of cafés, restaurants, and cultural venues are all close by.\n\nThe area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes operating along nearby Dame Street, making it an ideal base for city living.\n\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a centrally located home or a strong investment in Dublin's South City Centre."
      },
